# English. Lines are `key = text`; {0}, {1} are filled in by the program.
title = Discord
tip = Post each QSO logged to the Discord or Slack channels set in Options
menu.post = Auto-post QSOs
menu.post.tip = Post each QSO logged to {0}
enabled = Post each QSO to {0}
url = Webhook URL
url.tip.discord = The incoming webhook of the channel (channel settings > Integrations > Webhooks). Keep it secret: anyone with it can post.
url.tip.slack = The incoming webhook of the channel (a Slack app with Incoming Webhooks, Add New Webhook). Keep it secret: anyone with it can post.
shared = Every destination
edits = Also post corrections and deletions
preview = Posted as
note = QSOs are posted in the background, each destination at its own pace (Discord one message in two seconds, Slack one a second); when many are logged at once, they are combined into one message. QSOs received from other stations over Z-Link, imported or read from a file are not posted.
